      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "[Host Joe in a Calm but Pugnacious Tone] \n\nJoe: \"Hey folks, welcome back to Joe's Grind. Today, we're diving into the deep, dark ocean of them withooze-y trade deals. Now, that term might sound fancy, but let me break it down in plain English: these charlatans and corporate honchos are rigging the game so big corporations can import stuff from low-wage countries while pushing us Americans off the jobs ladder. It's America's favorite Hail Mary pass in the NFL. The other team's out there winning, and here we are watching ourselves get left on our own behind. Me? I'm sick to my stomach thinking we let these folks run our government. These folks in D.C. want high tariffs, low minimum wage, and interest rates, just like the sharks cruising the depths for our paychecks. It's a dog eat dog world, for goodness sake!\" \n\n[Transition Music]",
      "source": "target",
